    "sections": {
        "description": "Fashion Nook is a modern WooCommerce WordPress theme designed for women’s fashion brands, online boutiques, and clothing stores. Built specifically for selling women’s clothing, accessories, and lifestyle products, Fashion Nook combines clean design with flexible layouts to help your products stand out. Perfect for fashion boutiques, apparel shops, and style-driven brands, this theme offers beautifully designed shop pages, product layouts, and category templates optimized for WooCommerce. From new arrivals and featured collections to product detail pages and lookbook-style sections, Fashion Nook makes it easy to create a professional fashion store without writing code."
    },
